  <rules>
    <rule name="The Codex Astartes " id="ff12-6d31-8bd6-a176" hidden="false">
      <description>Primaris Space Marines automatically pass Fear and Regroup tests. When regrouping, Primaris units do not make a 3&quot; Regroup move, but can instead move, shoot, run or declare charges normally in that turn. Further, Primaris units caught by a Sweeping Advance are not destroyed, they instead remain locked in combat. 

Primaris Marines also benefit from Primaris Combat Doctrines and Chapter Tactics unique to their chapter.</description>
    </rule>
  </rules>
